{
  "title": "Contact Center Secure Data Capture: Let the Customer Type the Card Number | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "When a customer reads a card number aloud, the agent hears it and the recording keeps it. Secure data capture in CrestApps for Orchard Core takes the agent out of that moment: the agent sends a one-time link, the customer types the value on a secure page on their own device, and only a masked reference is kept.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why secure capture\n• The Secure Data Capture settings\n• The agent sends the link from the workspace\n• The customer's secure page, with the standard test card\n• What is kept\n• What a production site needs: a tokenization provider\n• Use cases",
